NAME: an initializer is resolved where its let binds it
DESCRIPTION: y = x names the outer x even under an inner let of x; fixed in i-7d2612-ce4c3b, see behtests/let_capture.beh
SRC:
(let (x 1)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 4))
    (DAT (store x) 0)
    (let (y x)
      (let (x 2)
        (seq
          (DAT (store x) 0)
          (DAT 0 (store y)) )))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $4     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #1     , #0     
_LET9 
  DAT    #2     , #0     
_LET8 
  DAT    #0     , $_LET1 
  DAT    $0     , $0     